{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "1b8c991eedfd9906b14b67945f2f5917d56821928c1ec54cd1b78853bf096235", "ja": "コメディエンヌへの道", "zh": "成为喜剧女演员之路", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a6c4246c0bd3b2fe9d669e9f19d347ef37e73750a10e77d713dc2cad4a764ec0", "ja": "プロデューサーから映画のオーディションに\n挑戦してみないかと提案された琴葉。経験の\n少ないコメディ映画ということで悩むが、\n自らの新境地を切り開くべく、仲間たちと\n共にオーディション合格を目指す。", "zh": "制作人向琴叶提议，要不要挑战一下电影试镜。她因自己在喜剧电影方面经验较少而烦恼，但为了开拓自己的新天地，和伙伴们一起以通过试镜为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "71ebe981abc2b86adace3e08b6503aef5e404b2856a4f1d00af8e04e0925872e", "ja": "数か月前……", "zh": "数个月前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3227dec61a48cff21fe450ccbd25be988a5162d4e60a7518889ee8a469e983b1", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。\n今、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "dcbca0509fac93648138b9b96f4b01033cd16aa4e9782cb80a61c8a013083ca8", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです！\n何かありましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c4bc1f263ffb0b6bee2f6d35934b4402de8ca5063e96aaf4ddb4aac070d7371c", "ja": "実は、映画のオーディションの話が来てるんだ。\n何人かに、受けてもらおうと思ってるんだけど……。", "zh": "其实是有个电影试镜的工作找上门了。\n我在想让几个人去参加看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c9b6d1ec0422c36569da69a4b32c93abc31b4e36dd062ff460510c1b3be1e6ec", "ja": "内容がけっこう面白そうで。\nせっかくだから、琴葉も受けてみないか？", "zh": "内容好像挺有意思的。\n机会难得，琴叶也要不要试着参加一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "ba650f4261faa5535fbba33f7c87da04e1c23fa1518c35445aec4ea3122f91cc", "ja": "映画ですか！？\nもちろん、やりたいです！　受けさせてください！", "zh": "是电影吗！？\n当然，我想参加！请让我去试镜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "00bfb8831103cc52e3864a3cf4d93afa031d84839332e77f3f98d9b5a9c0f210", "ja": "あっ……でも、面白そうって、\nどんな感じの作品なんですか？", "zh": "啊……不过，您说很有意思，\n那是怎样的作品呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "76d375a687049f2feebe8067a7a7dcb2c7a309c03dc7bfccb994a5e790aaa8be", "ja": "病院を舞台にした話なんだけど。\nミステリーであり、コメディかな。", "zh": "是以医院为舞台的故事。\n算是推理剧，也可以说是喜剧吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "7a6084af355fe055aafdca3a3a6c14c968edc89f386dde6d9ed97165e60fec29", "ja": "コメディですか！？　なるほど……。", "zh": "是喜剧吗！？原来如此……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "70b3ca1626e7404505d4a422f9d3fb294bce695c6ea0b4046b1d033431ed0b3e", "ja": "ちょっと変わり種なんだ。犯人が主人公で……\nあれ、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "算是有点特别的类型。犯人就是主角……\n咦，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "397fb26ba2d6be0ca8cee52cd96a3e370ac311b6b4941e83cd3696baf71295b6", "ja": "あ、いえ。コメディは、あまり経験がないので……\n私にできるのかな、と思っただけです。", "zh": "啊，不是。我只是没怎么演过喜剧……\n所以在想，我能不能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "40e533545da82a1638dde9da25c4bbb00a45807c58b9499f6da481a4ae5c7a31", "ja": "あまり馴染みのない分野だよな。でも、\nだからこそ挑戦してみる価値があるんじゃないか？", "zh": "这算是个不太熟悉的领域吧。不过，正因为如此，不是更值得挑战一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9e06850846fd9fc87615afc50d168312648cc4fb7566fb1d29fa997d26fb3166", "ja": "この仕事が成功すれば、琴葉の新境地が\n開けると思うんだ。", "zh": "如果这份工作能成功，我觉得琴叶就能开拓出全新的天地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "7aac19c4d0048b89bc21b9553093ead39cc1d3c0ed7880916cafc608c2f2995f", "ja": "新境地……。", "zh": "新的境界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "510ad65c04b8e589b5513e44d4712cfc8163b7f8a124258defba91cd90e21a24", "ja": "来週、オーディション参加者を集めてミーティングを\nする予定なんだ。それまでに考えておいてくれないか？", "zh": "下周打算召集参加试镜的人开个会。在那之前，你能先考虑一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "b430b1e503e9d2e1b531a6c01a5a0b50c361f1e24e36582b33cef9a77beb7fc6", "ja": "わかりました！\n……新境地、か……。", "zh": "明白了！\n……崭新的境界，吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1016_null", "source_sha256": "07bdc03f973bec7b12adcaab555bf0aa6254bf522737b6123a3a9e5c276abbc2", "ja": "翌週……", "zh": "下周……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a45cf137edd922aa502890abaa8752ba68997fb5840c4125cdfe4de6daeb72c3", "ja": "（今日は映画のオーディションに参加するアイドルを\n集めてのミーティングだ。集まったのは……）", "zh": "（今天是把参加电影试镜的偶像们召集起来开会。到场的有……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "aad33c92652d9a2ca28ea453c775d8e201084c4d48a38b5154ae94266c357738", "ja": "百合子も、オーディション受けるんだ！\n一緒にがんばろうね！", "zh": "百合子也要参加试镜啊！\n我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "44a45659361c69eab9f34ce6e2b547a25e3b2724f7173935355445c830cdb62d", "ja": "よろしくね、未来！　ミステリー作品に出られるなんて\nワクワクしちゃうな……私、絶対合格したいです！", "zh": "请多指教，未来！能出演悬疑作品，\n真是让人兴奋不已呢……我绝对要合格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "55c97aec5ac2013060f5ef3a237c2f3216523285c45c4f491b46937d95b30989", "ja": "風花さんが受けるのは、少し意外でした。\n今回の舞台、病院だし……。", "zh": "没想到风花小姐也会参加试镜。毕竟这次的舞台是在医院……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7b45a1a1ed406e301ae4222975e94c4af86a245e1ea703cb549abc5878e3c958", "ja": "私も、少し迷ったんだけどね。\nでも、なんだか面白そうなお話だったから。", "zh": "我也稍微犹豫了一下呢。\n不过，因为感觉是个很有意思的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2524e7bf3e1b3f8104515865574640940130c6979dd4f71a292b95c9bc746aa3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nオーディションに参加するのは、これで全員ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n参加试镜的，都在这里了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a9f5b3319a90954c266c60bd6d07b48e3585bedc13237714b64b8015e8b0596c", "ja": "いや、あとひとり……。", "zh": "不，还有一个人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1024_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "4f7cbe2f8354409d143a0a4fb5799369a4d42f67ebd5528f3329898ac2bd9411", "ja": "すみません、遅れました！", "zh": "对不起，我迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "aaab5e487ddac826d2d0497ba96129b24bf3214635013a7346dccbfc11362260", "ja": "あっ、琴葉ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "5f957a287830027b498f85eb7e49d70d16a889fde87696cd845a74aaa4160b27", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。急いでもらって悪かったな。\n仕事は無事終わったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。不好意思，得让你赶一趟。\n工作顺利结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "589e4d9271877255a1d6a7f123bee362a79f169c78140fb9dd32f04e555d1d3f", "ja": "はい、問題ありません。\nみんな、オーディションに参加するんだ。よろしくね！", "zh": "是的，没问题。\n大家要参加试镜。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2a03bf43a06ace6aebf5cab9af733fcf1313f945dbec949e8c2419dfd141b1d", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！\nわあ、手ごわいライバルが増えちゃったな。", "zh": "请多指教！\n哇，这下又多了好难对付的竞争对手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "f579b73d62d127d92ae5ae96d2309edf0f4112de71ecab7b7a280f12232b49e9", "ja": "大丈夫！　みんなで合格すればいいんだよ！\nそうですよね、風花さん♪", "zh": "没关系的！只要大家一起合格就好了嘛！\n对吧，风花小姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d06b6cc7ae20b1610f4170037dcd346f9da9e0011a96d8a94ef8ce9a2a4a292", "ja": "うん。撮影を乗り切るためにも、\n仲間は多い方が心強いもんね。", "zh": "嗯。为了顺利完成拍摄，伙伴当然是越多越让人安心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "6254ecdfa44b84888a4ff11c9dca40135b64891d6f2f21aa8780d272803b99a3", "ja": "簡単に言うほど、倍率は低くないと思いますけど……\nでも、そのくらいの気持ちで挑まないとですね。", "zh": "我觉得竞争倍率并没有说得那么低……\n不过，也得抱着那样的心情去挑战才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8a956c25919d4a06550a485b06cf305535f1b2fd92efa6a077fd3ad872d8552a", "ja": "ああ。そのためにも、まずはオーディションを\n突破しないとな。早速、作戦会議を始めるぞ！", "zh": "啊。为此，首先得通过试镜才行。马上开始作战会议吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
